OL,3,GNEWSAClub unveils special shirt
OL,4,Ainspired by Syd Barrett
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridge United FC has unveiled a
OL,7,Fspecial-edition fourth shirt for the
OL,8,Fseason inspired by the life of Pink
OL,9,FFloyd's Syd Barrett.
OL,11,FPlayers will wear the shirt at the U's
OL,12,Fgame against Blackpool, at Cledara
OL,13,FAbbey Stadium, on Saturday, which is
OL,14,Falso World Mental Health Day.
OL,16,FThe club said the project was created
OL,17,Fin collaboration with the Barrett
OL,18,FEstate and supported by Sony Music and
OL,19,FPink Floyd.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
